{"type":"message","id":"acfc2e77","parentId":"9607dc87","timestamp":"2026-04-10T07:35:03.798Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lOI1BF9sbG5TEAaXeIYfgMsb|fc_0dba6e5c46cdf3ad0169d8a8267eb48197acfc1d9f4aa95a93","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_to_onboarding/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_to_onboarding/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.2","usage":{"input":307,"output":31,"cacheRead":15616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15954,"cost":{"input":0.00053725,"output":0.000434,"cacheRead":0.0027328,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00370405}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775806491052}}
{"type":"message","id":"b452bb57","parentId":"acfc2e77","timestamp":"2026-04-10T07:35:03.815Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_lOI1BF9sbG5TEAaXeIYfgMsb|fc_0dba6e5c46cdf3ad0169d8a8267eb48197acfc1d9f4aa95a93","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fuiou_login_to_onboarding\ndescription: 冷启动富友通 App → 登录 → 进入商户入网 Step 1（执照信息页）。整合了原 fuiou_login_step0.1 和 fuiou_open_merchant_onboarding_step0.2 两个技能。\n---\n\n# fuiou_login_to_onboarding\n\n## 控制流约束\n\n- 每步严格遵循 **GATE_IN → 操作 → GATE_OUT** 模式，GATE_OUT 不通过则不推进\n- **禁止使用 screencap**（App 设置了 FLAG_SECURE，截图为 0 字节），所有界面判断统一使用 `uiautomator dump` + XML 解析\n- 输出报告**状态**，不报告判断\n\n## 环境常量\n\n```\nDEVICE=GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\nPKG=com.fuiou.pay.fybussess\nADB=adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\nUI_DUMP_CMD=adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml && adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n## 通用工具函数\n\n### dump_and_parse — 获取当前界面所有可见文字节点\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n```python\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\ntree = ET.parse('/tmp/ui.xml')\nfor node in tree.iter('node'):\n    t = node.get('text', '')\n    if t.strip():\n        print(f'{t} | bounds={node.get(\"bounds\")} | rid={node.get(\"resource-id\",\"\")}')\n```\n\n### get_current_activity\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\n```\n\n### tap_center(bounds) — 计算 bounds 中心并点击\n\nbounds 格式 `[x1,y1][x2,y2]`，中心 = ((x1+x2)/2, (y1+y2)/2)\n\n---\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### Step 1：启动 App\n\n**GATE_IN**：ADB 连接可用\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK devices | grep GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\n```\n- 输出含 `device` → 继续\n- 否则 → HALT `{ \"status\": \"adb_not_connected\" }`\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell monkey -p com.fuiou.pay.fybussess -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER 1\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：`get_current_activity` + `dump_and_parse`，按以下路由：\n\n| XML / Activity 特征 | 路由 |\n|---------------------|------|\n| mCurrentFocus 含 `LoginActivity` | → Step 2 |\n| mCurrentFocus 含 `MainActivity` | → Step 5 |\n| XML 中有 \"绑定手机提醒\" | → 内联处理弹窗（点\"否\"），再重新判断 |\n| 其他 Activity 属于 PKG | → `adb shell am start -n com.fuiou.pay.fybussess/.ui.login.LoginActivity`，再判断 |\n| 不属于 PKG 或无响应 | → HALT `{ \"status\": \"unexpected_activity\", \"current_focus\": \"...\" }` |\n\n---\n\n### Step 2：勾选协议\n\n**GATE_IN**：当前在 LoginActivity\n\n**操作**：`dump_and_parse`，在 XML 中找 `resource-id` 含 `agreementCb` 的 CheckBox 节点：\n- `checked=\"true\"` → 跳过，直接进入 Step 3\n- `checked=\"false\"` → tap_center 其 bounds 点击\n\n**实际行为**：点击 checkbox 会弹出 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗（而非直接勾选）\n\n**弹窗处理**：`dump_and_parse`，找到 `resource-id=\"com.fuiou.pay.fybussess:id/agreeTv\"` 的 \"同意\" 按钮，tap_center 点击。\n\n**GATE_OUT**：再次 `dump_and_parse`，确认 `agreementCb` 节点 `checked=\"true\"`\n- true → Step 3\n- 仍 false → 重试 1 次，仍 false → HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 3：点击登录\n\n**GATE_IN**：协议已勾选\n\n**操作**：`dump_and_parse`，找到 `resource-id=\"com.fuiou.pay.fybussess:id/userLoginTv\"` 的 \"登 录\" 按钮，tap_center 点击。sleep 3。\n\n**GATE_OUT**：`dump_and_parse`，按以下路由：\n\n| XML 特征 | 路由 |\n|----------|------|\n| 有 `aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider` 或 \"请拖动下方滑块\" 或 \"请按住滑块\" | → Step 4 |\n| 有 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗 | → 点\"同意\"，再次点登录，sleep 3，重新判断 |\n| mCurrentFocus 含 `MainActivity` | → Step 5 |\n| 仍在 LoginActivity 无变化 | → FAIL_PATH_B |\n\n**FAIL_PATH_B**：\n1. 检查 agreementCb 是否仍 checked=true → 否则回 Step 2\n2. 检查 userLoginTv 是否 enabled=true → 否则 HALT\n3. 重新点击登录 1 次，仍无响应 → HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 4：处理阿里云滑块验证\n\n**GATE_IN**：XML 中存在 `aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider`\n\n**操作**：\n\n1. 在 XML 中找到 `resource-id=\"aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider\"` 节点，获取其 bounds（实测约 `[130,1262][288,1415]`）\n2. 计算滑块手柄中心：cx = (x1+x2)/2, cy = (y1+y2)/2\n3. 找到 WebView 容器的右边界 x2（实测约 1054）\n4. 执行 swipe：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input swipe {cx} {cy} {webview_x2 - 30} {cy} 600\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：`get_current_activity`\n\n| 结果 | 路由 |\n|------|------|\n| mCurrentFocus 含 `MainActivity` | → Step 5 |\n| 仍含 `LoginActivity` 且 XML 仍有滑块 | → FAIL_PATH_C |\n| 仍含 `LoginActivity` 但无滑块（回到登录页） | → 可能验证失败已重置，回 Step 3 |\n\n**FAIL_PATH_C（滑块验证失败）**：\n1. 等 2s（等滑块重置），重新 dump 获取最新滑块 bounds\n2. 第 1 次重试：重新 swipe\n3. 第 2 次重试：Y 坐标 ±30px 微调\n4. 3 次均失败 → HALT `{ \"status\": \"slider_verification_failed\", \"attempts\": 3 }`\n\n---\n\n### Step 5：处理登录后弹窗\n\n**GATE_IN**：mCurrentFocus 含 `MainActivity`\n\n**操作**：`dump_and_parse`，检查弹窗：\n\n| XML 特征 | 处理 |\n|----------|------|\n| 有 \"绑定手机提醒\" | 找到 text=\"否\" 的按钮，tap_center 点击 |\n| 有其他弹窗（含关闭/取消/否按钮） | tap_center 关闭按钮 |\n| 无弹窗，可见 \"本月有效交易金额\" | → 直接进入 GATE_OUT |\n\n**GATE_OUT**：`dump_and_parse` 确认 XML 中可见 \"本月有效交易金额\" 且无弹窗遮盖\n- 通过 → Step 6\n- 仍有弹窗 → 重复处理（最多 3 次），仍有 → HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 6：点击 FAB 进入商户入网\n\n**GATE_IN**：主界面无弹窗\n\n**操作**：\n\nFAB (+号) 按钮固定在右下角，已验证 bounds `[952,1841][1067,1956]`，中心 (1009, 1898)。\n\n> **注意**：右上角 `onlineIv` bounds [977,127][1054,214] 是智能客服入口，不要点错。目标是**右下角**浮动按钮。\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap 1009 1898\nsleep 2\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：`dump_and_parse`，验证：\n\n```python\n# 必须同时满足\nassert any('商户入网' in node.text for node in nodes)\nassert any('执照信息' in node.text for node in nodes)\nassert any('请选择地区' in node.text for node in nodes)\n```\n\n- 三项均命中 → 完成\n- \"商户入网\" 找到但步骤不是 1 → 输出当前步骤\n- 均未找到 → FAIL_PATH_D\n\n**FAIL_PATH_D**：\n1. 检查 XML 内容判断当前页面\n2. 若进入了智能客服 → 按返回键，修正坐标重试\n3. 若仍在主界面无变化 → FAB 可能被遮挡，重试 1 次\n4. 仍失败 → HALT\n\n---\n\n## 最终输出\n\n```json\n{\n  \"page_state\": {\n    \"page_title\": \"商户入网\",\n    \"current_step\": \"1\",\n    \"step_name\": \"执照信息\",\n    \"visible_fields\": [\"商户所在地区\", \"商户类别\"],\n    \"buttons\": [\"保存\", \"下一步\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 验收场景\n\n| # | 初始状态 | 预期结果 |\n|---|---------|---------|\n| 1 | App 未启动，设备在桌面 | 启动 → 登录 → 滑块 → 关弹窗 → 点 FAB → 进入入网 Step 1 |\n| 2 | App 已在 MainActivity | 跳过登录 → 关弹窗 → 点 FAB → 进入入网 Step 1 |\n| 3 | App 在 LoginActivity，协议已勾选 | 跳过勾选 → 点登录 → 滑块 → 进入入网 Step 1 |\n| 4 | 滑块验证连续 3 次失败 | 输出 slider_verification_failed，HALT |\n| 5 | ADB 连接断开 | Step 1 GATE_IN 检测失败，HALT |\n| 6 | 登录后出现\"绑定手机提醒\" | 点\"否\"关闭 → 确认主界面 → 点 FAB → 进入入网 Step 1 |\n| 7 | 点 FAB 误进智能客服 | 识别错误页面 → 返回 → 修正重试 → 进入入网 Step 1 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775806503807}}
{"type":"message","id":"a9ac0356","parentId":"b452bb57","timestamp":"2026-04-10T07:35:06.450Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_RSChcYVCEf73bbKyHUJ6ZB75|fc_0dba6e5c46cdf3ad0169d8a829cdb88197b59dc275f22185ed","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_to_onboarding/runner.py"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_to_onboarding/runner.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.2","usage":{"input":2674,"output":30,"cacheRead":15744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18448,"cost":{"input":0.0046795,"output":0.00042,"cacheRead":0.0027551999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0078547}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775806503815}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ccad9c1","parentId":"a9ac0356","timestamp":"2026-04-10T07:35:06.468Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_RSChcYVCEf73bbKyHUJ6ZB75|fc_0dba6e5c46cdf3ad0169d8a829cdb88197b59dc275f22185ed","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nfuiou_login_to_onboarding runner — 富友通登录 → 进入商户入网 Step1 的确定性执行器\n\n整合原 fuiou_login_step0.1/runner.py，并根据实测修正：\n  - 去掉 screencap（FLAG_SECURE 下为 0 字节），统一用 uiautomator dump\n  - step2 增加 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗处理\n  - step4 从 XML 解析 aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider 的 bounds，不再盲猜 Y\n  - 新增 step7 点击 FAB 进入商户入网\n\n用法：\n  python3 runner.py run_all          # 全流程（登录 → 入网 Step1）\n  python3 runner.py step1_launch     # 单步执行\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport re\nimport time\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\n\nDEVICE = \"GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\"\nADB = \"/opt/homebrew/Caskroom/android-platform-tools/36.0.2/platform-tools/adb\"\nUI_XML_LOCAL = \"/tmp/ui.xml\"\nPKG = \"com.fuiou.pay.fybussess\"\n\n\n# ─── 基础工具 ───────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef adb(cmd: str) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess:\n    full_cmd = f\"{ADB} -s {DEVICE} {cmd}\"\n    return subprocess.run(full_cmd, shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=30)\n\n\ndef dump_ui() -> str:\n    \"\"\"导出 UI 树并拉到本地，返回 xml 内容\"\"\"\n    adb(\"shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\")\n    adb(\"pull /sdcard/ui.xml \" + UI_XML_LOCAL)\n    with open(UI_XML_LOCAL, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        return f.read()\n\n\ndef dump_ui_texts() -> list[dict]:\n    \"\"\"dump UI 并返回所有有文字的节点列表\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    tree = ET.parse(UI_XML_LOCAL)\n    nodes = []\n    for node in tree.iter('node'):\n        nodes.append({\n            'text': node.get('text', ''),\n            'rid': node.get('resource-id', ''),\n            'class': node.get('class', ''),\n            'bounds': node.get('bounds', ''),\n            'checked': node.get('checked', ''),\n            'checkable': node.get('checkable', ''),\n            'enabled': node.get('enabled', ''),\n        })\n    return nodes\n\n\ndef get_current_focus() -> str:\n    result = adb(\"shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\")\n    return result.stdout.strip()\n\n\ndef parse_bounds(bounds_str: str) -> tuple | None:\n    \"\"\"解析 bounds 字符串 '[x1,y1][x2,y2]'，返回 (cx, cy, x1, y1, x2, y2)\"\"\"\n    m = re.match(r'\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]', bounds_str)\n    if not m:\n        return None\n    x1, y1, x2, y2 = int(m.group(1)), int(m.group(2)), int(m.group(3)), int(m.group(4))\n    if x1 == 0 and y1 == 0 and x2 == 0 and y2 == 0:\n        return None\n    return ((x1 + x2) // 2, (y1 + y2) // 2, x1, y1, x2, y2)\n\n\ndef find_node(nodes: list[dict], **criteria) -> dict | None:\n    \"\"\"按条件在节点列表中查找第一个匹配节点。\n    支持 text=, rid_contains=, class_contains=, checked= 等\"\"\"\n    for n in nodes:\n        match = True\n        for k, v in criteria.items():\n            if k == 'text' and n['text'] != v:\n                match = False\n            elif k == 'text_contains' and v not in n['text']:\n                match = False\n            elif k == 'rid_contains' and v not in n['rid']:\n                match = False\n            elif k == 'class_contains' and v not in n['class']:\n                match = False\n            elif k == 'checked' and n['checked'] != v:\n                match = False\n        if match:\n            return n\n    return None\n\n\ndef tap(x: int, y: int, sleep_after: float = 0.5):\n    adb(f\"shell input tap {x} {y}\")\n    time.sleep(sleep_after)\n\n\ndef tap_node(node: dict, sleep_after: float = 0.5) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"点击节点中心，成功返回 True\"\"\"\n    b = parse_bounds(node['bounds'])\n    if not b:\n        return False\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after)\n    return True\n\n\ndef result_ok(next_step: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\", \"next\": next_step, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_need_llm(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"NEED_LLM\", \"reason\": reason, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_fail(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"FAIL\", \"reason\": reason, **extra}\n\n\n# ─── Step 实现 ──────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef step0_preflight() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"检查 ADB 连接\"\"\"\n    result = adb(\"devices\")\n    if DEVICE not in result.stdout or \"device\" not in result.stdout.split(DEVICE)[-1]:\n        return result_fail(\"adb_not_connected\", adb_output=result.stdout.strip())\n    return result_ok(\"step1_launch\")\n\n\ndef step1_launch() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"启动 App\"\"\"\n    adb(f\"shell monkey -p {PKG} -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER 1\")\n    time.sleep(3)\n\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    if PKG not in focus:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"wrong_app_or_not_started\",\n            current_focus=focus,\n            instruction=\"App 未正确启动。dump_ui_texts 查看当前页面。\"\n        )\n\n    if \"LoginActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step2_checkbox\", current_focus=focus)\n    elif \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step5_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n    else:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"unexpected_activity\",\n            current_focus=focus,\n            instruction=\"在富友通内但不是 Login/Main。dump_ui_texts 查看当前页面。\"\n        )\n\n\ndef step2_checkbox() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"勾选协议 checkbox，处理 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗\"\"\"\n    nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n\n    cb = find_node(nodes, rid_contains='agreementCb')\n    if not cb:\n        cb = find_node(nodes, class_contains='CheckBox', checkable='true')\n    if not cb:\n        return result_need_llm(\"checkbox_not_found\", instruction=\"ui.xml 中未找到协议 checkbox\")\n\n    if cb['checked'] == 'true':\n        return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\")\n\n    # 点击 checkbox\n    tap_node(cb)\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n\n    # 实测：点击后会弹出 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗，需要点 \"同意\"\n    nodes2 = dump_ui_texts()\n    agree_btn = find_node(nodes2, rid_contains='agreeTv')\n    if not agree_btn:\n        agree_btn = find_node(nodes2, text='同意')\n    if agree_btn:\n        tap_node(agree_btn, sleep_after=1)\n\n    # GATE_OUT：验证 checkbox 已勾选\n    nodes3 = dump_ui_texts()\n    cb2 = find_node(nodes3, rid_contains='agreementCb')\n    if not cb2:\n        cb2 = find_node(nodes3, class_contains='CheckBox', checkable='true')\n\n    if cb2 and cb2['checked'] == 'true':\n        return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\")\n\n    # 重试：点击父容器 xysLl\n    parent = find_node(nodes3, rid_contains='xysLl')\n    if parent:\n        tap_node(parent)\n        nodes4 = dump_ui_texts()\n        # 再次处理弹窗\n        agree2 = find_node(nodes4, text='同意')\n        if agree2:\n            tap_node(agree2, sleep_after=1)\n        nodes5 = dump_ui_texts()\n        cb3 = find_node(nodes5, rid_contains='agreementCb')\n        if cb3 and cb3['checked'] == 'true':\n            return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\")\n\n    return result_fail(\"checkbox_still_unchecked\")\n\n\ndef step3_click_login() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击登录按钮\"\"\"\n    nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n\n    login_btn = find_node(nodes, rid_contains='userLoginTv')\n    if not login_btn:\n        login_btn = find_node(nodes, text='登 录')\n    if not login_btn:\n        login_btn = find_node(nodes, text='登录')\n    if not login_btn:\n        return result_need_llm(\"login_button_not_found\", instruction=\"ui.xml 中未找到登录按钮\")\n\n    login_bounds = parse_bounds(login_btn['bounds'])\n    tap_node(login_btn, sleep_after=2)\n\n    # 检查是否弹出 \"是否确认同意\" 弹窗（未勾选协议时可能出现）\n    nodes2 = dump_ui_texts()\n    if find_node(nodes2, text_contains='确认同意'):\n        agree = find_node(nodes2, text='同意')\n        if agree:\n            tap_node(agree, sleep_after=1)\n            # 再点登录\n            if login_bounds:\n                tap(login_bounds[0], login_bounds[1], sleep_after=2)\n\n    # GATE_OUT\n    time.sleep(1)\n    nodes3 = dump_ui_texts()\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step5_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    # 检查滑块\n    slider = find_node(nodes3, rid_contains='aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider')\n    if slider or find_node(nodes3, text_contains='拖动') or find_node(nodes3, text_contains='滑块'):\n        return result_ok(\"step4_slider\")\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"login_click_no_response\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"点击登录后既没进入滑块页也没进入主界面。dump_ui_texts 查看当前页面。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step4_slider() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"处理阿里云滑块验证 — 从 XML 解析滑块位置，不再盲猜\"\"\"\n    nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n\n    # 找滑块手柄\n    slider = find_node(nodes, rid_contains='aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider')\n    if not slider:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"slider_element_not_found\",\n            instruction=\"XML 中未找到 aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider。dump_ui_texts 查看当前页面。\"\n        )\n\n    sb = parse_bounds(slider['bounds'])\n    if not sb:\n        return result_fail(\"slider_bounds_invalid\", bounds=slider['bounds'])\n\n    slider_cx, slider_cy = sb[0], sb[1]\n\n    # 找 WebView 容器右边界\n    webview = find_node(nodes, class_contains='WebView')\n    if webview:\n        wb = parse_bounds(webview['bounds'])\n        target_x = wb[4] - 30 if wb else 1020  # x2 - 30\n    else:\n        target_x = 1020  # 默认值\n\n    max_attempts = 3\n    for attempt in range(max_attempts):\n        # 每次重试微调 Y ±20px\n        y_offset = attempt * 20 if attempt > 0 else 0\n        swipe_y = slider_cy + y_offset\n\n        adb(f\"shell input swipe {slider_cx} {swipe_y} {target_x} {swipe_y} 600\")\n        time.sleep(3)\n\n        focus = get_current_focus()\n        if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n            return result_ok(\"step5_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n        # 额外等待（可能在 loading）\n        time.sleep(2)\n        focus = get_current_focus()\n        if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n            return result_ok(\"step5_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n        # 重新 dump 获取最新滑块位置（滑块可能重置了）\n        nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n        slider = find_node(nodes, rid_contains='aliyunCaptcha-sliding-slider')\n        if slider:\n            sb = parse_bounds(slider['bounds'])\n            if sb:\n                slider_cx, slider_cy = sb[0], sb[1]\n        elif not find_node(nodes, text_contains='滑块'):\n            # 滑块消失但没进 MainActivity — 可能回到了登录页\n            return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\", message=\"slider_disappeared_retry_login\")\n\n    return result_fail(\"slider_failed_3_attempts\", attempts=max_attempts)\n\n\ndef step5_post_login_popup() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"处理登录后弹窗（绑定手机提醒等）\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(1)\n    dismiss_texts = [\"否\", \"取消\", \"暂不\", \"关闭\"]\n    popup_keywords = [\"绑定手机\", \"提醒\", \"温馨提示\"]\n\n    for round_num in range(3):\n        nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n        has_popup = any(find_node(nodes, text_contains=kw) for kw in popup_keywords)\n\n        if not has_popup:\n            break\n\n        for btn_text in dismiss_texts:\n            btn = find_node(nodes, text=btn_text)\n            if btn:\n                tap_node(btn, sleep_after=1)\n                break\n\n    # GATE_OUT\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n    nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus and find_node(nodes, text_contains='本月有效交易金额'):\n        return result_ok(\"step6_tap_fab\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_tap_fab\", current_focus=focus, warning=\"主界面可见但未找到仪表盘文字\")\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"main_activity_not_confirmed\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"处理弹窗后未确认在主界面。dump_ui_texts 查看当前页面。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step6_tap_fab() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击右下角 FAB (+号) 进入商户入网\"\"\"\n    # FAB 已验证 bounds [952,1841][1067,1956]，中心 (1009, 1898)\n    # 注意：右上角 onlineIv [977,127][1054,214] 是客服入口，不要混淆\n    tap(1009, 1898, sleep_after=2)\n\n    # GATE_OUT\n    nodes = dump_ui_texts()\n\n    has_title = find_node(nodes, text_contains='商户入网')\n    has_step1 = find_node(nodes, text_contains='执照信息')\n    has_field = find_node(nodes, text_contains='请选择地区')\n\n    if has_title and has_step1:\n        visible_fields = [n['text'] for n in nodes if n['text'].strip() and '请选择' in n['text']]\n        return result_ok(\n            \"DONE\",\n            page_state={\n                \"page_title\": \"商户入网\",\n                \"current_step\": \"1\",\n                \"step_name\": \"执照信息\",\n                \"visible_fields\": visible_fields,\n            }\n        )\n\n    # 可能误点了客服图标\n    if find_node(nodes, text_contains='客服') or find_node(nodes, text_contains='智能'):\n        adb(\"shell input keyevent KEYCODE_BACK\")\n        time.sleep(1)\n        # 修正坐标重试\n        tap(1009, 1898, sleep_after=2)\n        nodes2 = dump_ui_texts()\n        if find_node(nodes2, text_contains='商户入网') and find_node(nodes2, text_contains='执照信息'):\n            return result_ok(\"DONE\", page_state={\"page_title\": \"商户入网\", \"current_step\": \"1\", \"step_name\": \"执照信息\"})\n\n    # FAB 可能被遮挡，重试一次\n    tap(1009, 1898, sleep_after=2)\n    nodes3 = dump_ui_texts()\n    if find_node(nodes3, text_contains='商户入网') and find_node(nodes3, text_contains='执照信息'):\n        return result_ok(\"DONE\", page_state={\"page_title\": \"商户入网\", \"current_step\": \"1\", \"step_name\": \"执照信息\"})\n\n    all_texts = [n['text'] for n in nodes3 if n['text'].strip()]\n    return result_fail(\"fab_not_working\", visible_texts=all_texts)\n\n\ndef run_all() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"全流程：登录 → 进入商户入网 Step 1\"\"\"\n    r = step0_preflight()\n    if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n        return r\n\n    step = r[\"next\"]\n    while step != \"DONE\":\n        if step not in STEPS:\n            return result_fail(\"unknown_step\", step=step)\n        r = STEPS[step]()\n        if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n            return r  # NEED_LLM 或 FAIL，停下\n        step = r.get(\"next\", \"DONE\")\n\n    return r\n\n\n# ─── Step 注册表 ─────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSTEPS = {\n    \"step0_preflight\": step0_preflight,\n    \"step1_launch\": step1_launch,\n    \"step2_checkbox\": step2_checkbox,\n    \"step3_click_login\": step3_click_login,\n    \"step4_slider\": step4_slider,\n    \"step5_post_login_popup\": step5_post_login_popup,\n    \"step6_tap_fab\": step6_tap_fab,\n    \"run_all\": run_all,\n}\n\n\n# ─── CLI 入口 ────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef main():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        print(json.dumps({\n            \"usage\": \"python3 runner.py <step_name>\",\n            \"available_steps\": list(STEPS.keys()),\n            \"recommended\": \"python3 runner.py run_all\"\n        }, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    step_name = sys.argv[1]\n    if step_name not in STEPS:\n        print(json.dumps(result_fail(\"unknown_step\", step=step_name, available=list(STEPS.keys())),\n                         ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    func = STEPS[step_name]\n    r = func()\n    print(json.dumps(r, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775806506461}}
